Package: biometrydata
Title: Datasets for the Biometry Course (PCB 6455 / BSC 4933)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Brian", "Maitner", , "bmaitner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Every dataset used in Biometry at the University of South
    Florida, ready to use after library(biometrydata). The same data can be
    downloaded file by file from the course repository; each help page gives
    the link and the original source and license.
License: file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/bmaitner/biometry_course
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
